  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0114" xml:lang="de">
        <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00385/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
          <div>
            <ab hand="#hand_gray_oegfl">
              <lb/>A2 <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Auden</rs>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_cc_bronold">
            <opener>
              <dateline>
                <date>
                  <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="42"/>12.Sept. l973
                </date>
              </dateline>
              <salute>
                <lb/>Lieber <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_129">Herr Benning</rs><subst><del rend="erased" hand="#type_cc_bronold">?</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">,</add></subst>
              </salute>
            </opener>
            <p>
              <lb/>anbei folgende <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Auden</rs>-Gedichte:
              <seg>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_313">Lied</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_314">Der unbekannte Bürger</rs>
                <lb/><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_blue_bronold"><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_315">Die Manager</rs></del>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_316">Einsame Überlegene</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_317">Pfingstsonntag in Kirchstetten</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_89">Josef Weinheber</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_318">Elegie</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_319">Prolog mit Sechzig</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_234">Profil</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_320">Einige Zeilen für Dr.Walter Birk</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_222">Knittelverse eines Altbürgers</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_321">Altersheim</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_322">Kurze Ode an den Kuckuck</rs>
                <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_323">Mondlandung</rs>
              </seg>
            </p>
            <p>
              <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="5"/>Ich habe sie in der Reihenfolge gelassen, wie sie im Buch
              <lb/>stehen werden, nämlich chronologisch. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>Selbstverständlich
              <lb/>können <subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_cc_bronold">s</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">S</add></subst>ie umstellen, wenn Sie es besser finden. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>Auch was
              <lb/>die Länge betrifft, so weiss ich nicht, ob ich genug oder zu
              <lb/>viel ausgewählt habe. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/><subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_cc_bronold">E</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">I</add></subst>hre Lesung soll 35 bis 40 Minuten
              <lb/>dauern. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>Wenn es zuviel ist, so bitte ich Sie nur zu beachten,
              <lb/>dass Sie von <rs type="person" ref="amp_person_214 amp_person_220 amp_person_222 amp_person_173 amp_person_78 amp_person_216 amp_person_218">jedem <subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_cc_bronold">P</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">Ü</add></subst>bersetzer</rs> ein Gedicht überlassen - sonst
              <lb/>gibt's wi<add place="inline" hand="#type_cc_bronold">e</add>der Verstimmungen.
            </p>
            <closer>
              <salute>
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="6"/>V<subst><del rend="metamark" hand="#hand_blue_bronold">ei</del><add place="inline" hand="#hand_blue_bronold">ie</add></subst>len Dank und herzliche Grüsse
              </salute>
              <salute>
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="43"/>Ihre
              </salute>
            </closer>
          </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00386/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
